   ],
   "title": "EXPRESSION SOURCE \u2014 the one job image 2 has",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Image 2 is an expression chart: a photograph of a stranger, held up beside the drawing so that one thing can be read off it. Read from image 2 only the angle of the brows \u2014 raised, level, or pulled down and knotted \u2014 how wide the eyes are open or how tightly they are shut, where the gaze goes, and the shape of the mouth, both how far it opens and which way its corners turn. Give that same expression to the man in image 1, drawn in his own cartoon features and as strongly as the photograph shows it. The face, hair, skin, age and clothing of the photograph stay inside the photograph."
   ],
   "color": "#223",
   "bgcolor": "#335"
  },
